Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 14:49:34 +0300
Subject: debrand: remove the wordmark, donate and feedback from the home page

The wordmark was the largest piece of branding in the app. AGPL-3.0 licenses
the code, not the trademark, so a debranded build must not ship it -- the
same reason the desktop icons are overlaid from brand/desktop.

The home page also had its own donate button pointing at upstream's ko-fi,
separate from the settings entry, and a "Give feedback on Stoat" button that
opened the feedback settings page -- which no longer exists, so it would have
opened settings on a blank panel.

The Lounge and Discover buttons are left alone: both are gated on
CONFIGURATION.IS_STOAT, which compares the configured API URL against
stoat.chat and is already false here.
